  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.139\n\nReleased on 2026-10-06.\n\nBuilt-in transcription now runs inside the HyperFrames desktop app. `transcribe --json` streams words as they are heard, except with parakeet-mlx. Studio drags after a resize, undo or reload land where they were pressed.\n\n## Features\n\n- **CLI:** Stream heard words on the transcribe --json progress stream ([156e87766](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/156e87766c77c8b9c680b7dc107f94b4ee734f17), [#5127](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5127)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **CLI:** Read the WAV in JS so Built-in transcription runs inside Electron ([f7bba2288](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/f7bba2288dfcbfbf0c93c8c63caee1893a442b9d), [#5129](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5129)).\n- **Core:** Keep nested scenes in place during a drag when the root has no timeline ([d94708e53](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/d94708e5312df021e1fdcac421f00ed3015f11bd), [#5115](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5115)).\n- **Core:** Renders keep a fromTo's from-only values from the frame it starts on ([755ab7d16](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/755ab7d1657ff2c2b6e2bd712ffbfcab97a617f5), [#5125](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5125)).\n- **Studio:** Drags after a resize, undo or reload land where they were pressed ([dc244d765](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/dc244d765c3e825e12d06311ad6d4f09b77be3f3), [#5088](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5088)).\n- **CLI:** Let parakeet-mlx detect the language and name the Parakeet install under auto ([34552a21d](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/34552a21d20e688cfa7a62925c53dee9a2634eff), [#5124](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5124)).\n- **Studio:** A timeline jump no longer starts thumbnail loads it is about to cancel ([b9e511a76](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/b9e511a7687a5b035a140325f2db3ddcb455cb5f), [#5085](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5085)).\n\n## Performance\n\n- **Studio:** Parse saved HTML once when syncing timeline length ([e8cfd6b73](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/e8cfd6b73eaa792d5ebe8e3f0a8ef4d99c348d7e), [#5092](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5092)).\n\n## Catalog\n\n- **Registry:** Gooey split block with metaball goo and directional motion blur ([b50dead1d](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/b50dead1da595786c4de5772332885781b288791), [#5123](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5123)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.138...v0.8.139\n"
